      "message": "fix(stock): fit-to-models and the stock strip measure the parts, never the fixtures\n\nThe Stock page's Fit to Models (box, cylinder, per-side) and its\n\"Models:\" readout read setup_align::solid_aabb_in, which walks every\nmodel - vises, accessories, plates and tagged fixtures included - so a\nfitted stock grew around the vise. The fit now lives in\ncamcraft_app::stock_fit: part_bounds (the #1529 part_aabb_in set), a\nparts-only radius twin for the snug cylinder, and fit_command, the one\nundoable SetStock both the GUI and a new MCP tool fit_stock run.\nCollision checks are unchanged.\n\nFixes #1538\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
