        "date": "2026-11-13T21:44:10Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(stock): name a negative fit margin and fixtures-only documents\n\nA negative or non-finite box/cylinder margin is refused by name with its\nvalue instead of \"no usable extent\"; a document holding only fixtures\nsays no part models are there (fixtures are not measured) instead of\n\"no models\". An empty document keeps its old polite status. Adds the\nmissing #1538 note on the stock_fit module line.\n\nRefs #1538\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
