        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-13T21:44:10Z"
      },
      "message": "test(stock): pin aligned-setup fits and the kept stock rotation\n\nA 40 x 20 x 8 off-origin part, its setup quarter-turned [0,0,90] and\nflipped [180,0,0] through AlignPartToSetup::turn (WCS pivot): the box,\ncylinder and per-side fits, with and without a 5 in vise, wrap the\npart in the setup's frame. A 30-degree stock rotation survives every\nfit. The negative margin and fixtures-only refusals are pinned, and the\nMCP test's undo asserts the stock is restored.\n\nRefs #1538\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
